  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
